{"id": "9202e58eb0b05c97", "field": "text", "it": "Saluti e omaggi, <eroe/eroina>! Ho le ultime notizie da entrambi i continenti e da terre ancora più lontane, per te.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g03-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9202e58eb0b05c97", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "920f80f4ad83df0d", "field": "text", "it": "Che i venti ti portino buone nuove. Come posso aiutarti?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "920f80f4ad83df0d", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "921387bee7ff7d92", "field": "text", "it": "Parla con Pephredo alla Darkbriar Lodge, nella ⟦Valley of Spirits=Valle degli Spiriti⟧, più in alto e a ovest della ⟦Valley of Strength=Valle della Forza⟧.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "921387bee7ff7d92", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "9221093d2a013bb3", "field": "text", "it": "Mostrami i tuoi grimori.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g03-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9221093d2a013bb3", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92280cd76b2feecc", "field": "text", "it": "Guardie! Guardie!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92280cd76b2feecc", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "922d2104104fdd25", "field": "text", "it": "Non mi resta molto tempo in questo mondo, ma se la Luce vorrà, sarà tempo sufficiente per compiere il mio destino. Quando affronterai il barone Fieramorte, sarò con te.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "922d2104104fdd25", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "9233f934961a27b8", "field": "text", "it": "Ci sarà dolore...", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9233f934961a27b8", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "9235088ab88b077a", "field": "text", "it": "Non provocarmi, o t'infilzo sulle mie corna!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9235088ab88b077a", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "923579bbf5a542da", "field": "text", "it": "Te lo dico io, la Grande Guerra non mi manca per niente. Ricordo quando combattemmo a Darrowmere. Tutta la notte nella nebbia, stesi in una trincea piena di fango.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "923579bbf5a542da", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "9237a3b97c84b6a2", "field": "text", "it": "Mi hai tenuto in quella cella troppo a lungo, mostro!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9237a3b97c84b6a2", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "923a1e322356c681", "field": "text", "it": "Salute, <cittadino/cittadina>.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "923a1e322356c681", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "925a6722bd118d98", "field": "text", "it": "Cosa ti porta in questa parte del mondo, {name}?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g03-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "925a6722bd118d98", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "925a95d4e38eff3c", "field": "text", "it": "Non allarmarti... anche se i miei grifoni non sono del tutto integri, ti porteranno fedelmente a destinazione. Dimmi... quale torre cerchi?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "925a95d4e38eff3c", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "9265a84de18f2313", "field": "text", "it": "Non riesco a scendere. Ho paura.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "9265a84de18f2313", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "926f4b2f2a1c0752", "field": "text", "it": "Ho... fallito...", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "926f4b2f2a1c0752", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "928d0889f561ed5b", "field": "text", "it": "Oh cielo, le mie scorte stanno finendo pericolosamente! Cosa ci mette tanto quel maledetto goblin?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "928d0889f561ed5b", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "929a9d60ec3247b7", "field": "text", "it": "È una storia leggendaria, e non ho né il tempo né la voglia di raccontarla di nuovo. Sappi solo che Medivh fu l'ultimo dei Guardiani. Il granbastone Atiesh era il fulcro del suo potere e il fulcro della corruzione.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "929a9d60ec3247b7", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92b3ac69cc17d7ae", "field": "text", "it": "Aku'mai esige altri sacrifici, ora devi morire!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92b3ac69cc17d7ae", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92b6e29c75eef60f", "field": "text", "it": "Ho udito le tue parole, ⟦Great Bear Spirit=Grande Spirito Orso⟧, e ho capito. Ora chiedo la tua benedizione per apprendere appieno la via dell'Artiglio.", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["tiebreak"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-r101-sg9@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92b6e29c75eef60f", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": [{"it": "Ho udito le tue parole, ⟦Great Bear Spirit=Grande Spirito Orso⟧, e ho capito. Ora chiedo la tua benedizione per apprendere appieno la via dell'Artiglio.", "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g03-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}}]}
{"id": "92b74e7b45c66024", "field": "text", "it": "Inchinati al mio cospetto, insetto! Di certo senti il potere che ho su di te.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92b74e7b45c66024", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92c2d00d6f75e39b", "field": "text", "it": "Fu quel giorno che ci vennero donati i silvagufi. Guardiani feroci: la dea affidò ai silvagufi la protezione di tutti i suoi luoghi sacri.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92c2d00d6f75e39b", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92c4b5d9478a1abc", "field": "text", "it": "Anche piccole modifiche agli ingredienti di una pozione possono cambiarla radicalmente. Pazienza e precisione, giovane: ti saranno utili in ogni ambito della vita.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92c4b5d9478a1abc", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "92c536c054cde74b", "field": "text", "it": "Brahaha! Che facce hanno fatto quando il cannone del vecchio Trollplow si è girato verso di loro! Le loro seghe non sono riuscite nemmeno a sfiorarmi!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g29-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "92c536c054cde74b", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
